.SH "نام (NAME)"
daxctl \- Provides enumeration and provisioning commands for the Linux kernel Device\-DAX facility
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.sp
.nf
\fIdaxctl\fP [\-\-version] [\-\-help] COMMAND [ARGS]
.fi
.br
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.sp
\-v, \-\-version
.RS 4
Display daxctl version.
.RE
.sp
\-h, \-\-help
.RS 4
Run daxctl help command.
.RE
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.sp
The daxctl utility provides enumeration and provisioning commands for
the Linux kernel Device\-DAX facility. This facility enables DAX mappings
of performance / feature differentiated memory without need of a
filesystem.
